It works alongside Samsung Find, not instead of it: Samsung Find locates and locks the phone, and CrookCatcher shows you who tried to get past the lock. It has to be installed before the phone goes missing. CrookCatcher has been downloaded more than 12 million times since 2014 and takes around 1.2 million intruder photos a day. For Samsung's own lock screen settings, see [how to see who tried to unlock your Samsung phone](/blog/samsung-who-tried-to-unlock).

